  "structure": {
    "block_count": 58,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "IVF Due Date Calculator",
        "text_sha256": "669f2cc676ab455c6870a8e8dcfda73b8bad6b83b9b1ad3f865bc6baf7eebecb",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "How do you calculate your baby’s due date with an IVF pregnancy? Use our IVF Due Date Calculator to find out when your baby will arrive with either a 3-day or 5-day IVF embryo transfer date.",
        "text_sha256": "454314cd633051cf1bea907dc63ad8534227bc75619e415328ef7c952dc7d421",
        "word_count": 36
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "How to Calculate IVF Due Date",
        "text_sha256": "8ee7549b258e573c5a2b5a8def1f31004aa189361f5d4fece505dd69d5cc11d7",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "What is an IVF pregnancy due date?",
        "text_sha256": "3b93caa7b3ebe724a48cab6f18b434fae8d825a4c16948e9420bad467c67ada6",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "What other ways can you calculate your IVF due date?",
        "text_sha256": "1bb5342ba3b6cba9d70b1d6dd9199dead152e721834cf0b4baef6701f2150887",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "How do you calculate your due date if you get pregnant without IVF?",
        "text_sha256": "f1cd890da7d3f816e8c0fed6e9ce081509fa91ad57ff362744608ace166036b4",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "What is an IVF pregnancy due date?",
        "text_sha256": "3b93caa7b3ebe724a48cab6f18b434fae8d825a4c16948e9420bad467c67ada6",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "An IVF pregnancy due date is an estimated due date for your baby’s arrival if you conceived via in vitro fertilization (IVF) . It’s based on your IVF embryo transfer date.",
        "text_sha256": "fdf9414bd48fb039274bb8b25721850b1c2f4a0c6f69ba2c00d177fd7ce494cf",
        "word_count": 31
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Most embryo transfers happen either three days or five days after egg retrieval and fertilization, using your own fresh or frozen embryos. A frozen embryo transfer is also known as an FET.",
        "text_sha256": "3656900a841695659985d138b0065c6f27a29461fdd57b1a1ce5ec4d53e2f7e0",
        "word_count": 32
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "3-day embryo transfer",
        "text_sha256": "5b27471f64c22c69edf32f7be06b25efce0799ef00a26c60a030d4304c002e67",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you had a three-day IVF embryo transfer, count or add 263 days from the transfer date to calculate your due date. You can also take your transfer date, add 266 days (38 weeks) to it and subtract three days. Or choose the “3-day transfer” option from our dropdown menu above.",
        "text_sha256": "fcfa4d89164e04b84fef43240abde069dc2cf9c30fc7ae3ac7884d6ea473b940",
        "word_count": 51
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "5-day embryo transfer",
        "text_sha256": "0718f7f1c7619c5ae8c4b6b083f0957c6ef46b81e961c4831e0512a8d18bbcdf",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you had a five-day embryo transfer, count 261 days from that date to calculate your due date. Put another way, you can add 266 days to your transfer date and then subtract five days. Or pick “5-day transfer” in the tool above.",
        "text_sha256": "a0663c95f16afe4eb2f89f87761c657878a93f28e276b9d3f76ed8e0b21165d7",
        "word_count": 43
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Want to find other parents going through an IVF pregnancy with the same birth month as you? Connect with them on the What to Expect app .",
        "text_sha256": "ab38acdb6cd6327dc369af5d0fd608a628c545aca159583bb81fa2bd3da974ba",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "What other ways can you calculate your IVF due date?",
        "text_sha256": "1bb5342ba3b6cba9d70b1d6dd9199dead152e721834cf0b4baef6701f2150887",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "You can calculate your due date if you have an embryo transfer date of more than five days – you just subtract that number of days from 266 and add that number to the transfer date. These calculations also apply if you undergo embryo transfer following egg donation or donor embryo cycles.",
        "text_sha256": "49ce49e2309a3e96b122b739272035ff40d4cab856eeebb623df68b75f49b182",
        "word_count": 52
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you use a donor egg, there’s also a way to calculate your due date. With either a fresh donor egg or a donor embryo, count 266 days from the date of egg retrieval to get your estimated due date.",
        "text_sha256": "3b5e1542d9a0911abe73f6ba5db82154fef248c7d799d11ac8e5c5edf003dcc0",
        "word_count": 40
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "How do you calculate your due date if you get pregnant without IVF?",
        "text_sha256": "f1cd890da7d3f816e8c0fed6e9ce081509fa91ad57ff362744608ace166036b4",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you happen to get pregnant without IVF, you can calculate your due date using your last menstrual period (LMP), your date of conception if you know it, or the date of your first ultrasound scan if you have an early one.",
        "text_sha256": "8b4d0f0911b9b9887193733b78cc526842b825c9be9c9662a2c63353ab5721a2",
        "word_count": 42
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Use our pregnancy due date calculator to find out more about all these methods of figuring out when baby will arrive, and try each one that’s applicable to you!",
        "text_sha256": "3168c73edc8e4a38e2c24cbe3da8816ea6570d77b5c5f9ba59eb8acdb1c70fea",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "How accurate are IVF due dates, according to moms?",
        "text_sha256": "305acdca2ecc0e2837adba19e093c948a7fddf35c0490b7bcd50e5515b80683f",
        "word_count": 9
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Moms from the What to Expect Community have had a range of experiences when it comes to whether their babies were born on their IVF due dates or not.",
        "text_sha256": "96cb25377ce6375d59fe545d1a8bfdec70088eed27579d9fe63f99a294cea1eb",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
        "block_index": 22,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“With my first IVF pregnancy, my water broke at 8 p.m. on my due date!” says What to Expect parent cmnoel.",
        "text_sha256": "1fd48314b5023a6818d14ee4e186b087184c23194f6621cbb7310e744a1aaaf9",
        "word_count": 21
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000023",
        "block_index": 23,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“My IVF baby came 5 days early,” says another What to Expect mom Annabelle621. “I think he just wanted out!”",
        "text_sha256": "b90af39e90af120b85b9504707b52727aecaff96d9cd21d4208831c2dbfa3c97",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000024",
        "block_index": 24,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“Mine was born one day before due date,” says What to Expect Community member frosty2k.",
        "text_sha256": "a6b6407af20a791923bf0c0aac199074d1342d16ba1d3df35b67eb99b05c8145",
        "word_count": 15
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000025",
        "block_index": 25,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“I was induced at 41 weeks. She was very cozy in there!” says mom arcwv9.",
        "text_sha256": "c88e9b35b51f51fddfd7ceb95329b90a43aa2296e33aeae8a2d7dab74ad9a44c",
        "word_count": 15
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000026",
        "block_index": 26,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The bottom line? While your IVF baby’s conception may have been scheduled, her arrival may be a little less predictable!",
        "text_sha256": "7cfd9ccd122c091059ad5f0ab01832dc702e3b3b58fa23eb6cb40d857970fafd",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000027",
        "block_index": 27,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Other resources",
        "text_sha256": "e69760843d3013232dcfe37d430ed9da7b252d6896dbf349b29fed7436e264fe",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000028",
